== Trivia ==
* In Western culture, children are commonly told that if they behave badly during the year, they will receive a piece of coal for [[wikipedia:Christmas|Christmas]].
** This makes A Lump of Coal a fitting item for Krampus to drop, based on his [[wikipedia:Krampus|origins]].

