{{Bug|In [[Greed Mode]], if Isaac picks up{{i|A Lump of Coal}} in a Silver {{r|Treasure Room}} and then fights {{e|Krampus}},{{i|A Lump of Coal}} may still drop after the fight. Since this item's effect does not stack with itself, this will give Isaac a useless item.}}{{Nav}}